@startuml state-module
!include style.puml
title Lifecycle of a module in the compiler

[*] --> Discovered : named by an import or as the main file
Discovered --> Parsed : SyntaxTree built
Parsed --> Resolved : names and imports bound
Resolved --> Checked : types and subset rules hold
Checked --> Lowered : TyirFunction for each function
Lowered --> [*]

Discovered --> Failed : file missing or unreadable
Parsed --> Failed : syntax errors
Resolved --> Failed : unknown name or circular import
Checked --> Failed : type or subset errors
Failed --> [*] : diagnostics reported
@enduml
